== Process for Synergy 1 Public Release ==

=== During Development ===

# Create release branch (e.g. v1.2)
# Make code changes (do not commit to master)
# Follow [[Testing Release]] when ready to test

=== Public Release Process ===

# Ensure that ChangeLog file is up to date
# Ensure version number in CMakeLists.txt is correct
# Ensure stage name in CMakeLists.txt is correct (stable, beta, etc)
# Test snapshot on all operating systems
# Close the release milestone
# Tag the release branch
# Merge release branch into master
# Delete the release branch
# Upload to public website and test links
# Set current version in website settings
# Test all download links
# Install previous version and test update check feature
# Set next version in <code>CMakeLists.txt</code> (master branch)